  patti lupone seemed like a person you  read about in a book or heard about  somewhere but not someone you saw  perform  you know not for me not not for a kid  from utah  [Music]  what's even harder to believe  patty lupone is now his co-star you  could drive a person crazy  you could drive a person mad  a twist of fate that goes back to the  stranger who gave him the means to watch  one of broadway's biggest productions  it takes that kind of generosity  to show you what generosity can be to  turn it around and do it again  giving back is now a big part of clay's  life once a month he and his  four-year-old son pay for strangers meal  at their local diner and recently  through his social media he started to  give away free tickets to a show company  he posted it on instagram along with the  backstory of why  somebody asked for my venmo said i'd  like to send you some more money to buy  tickets he sent me seven hundred dollars  i don't know who i don't know him more  people started sending me money more  people started sending me money i'm  still giving away tickets i've given  away  150 tickets so far how much money have  people given you close to ten thousand  dollars what's even more  he found the stranger the minute he said  putnam county spelling bee  it all came back his name is mark howell  and he lives in la we got to be there  for their first zoom reunion it's been  really overwhelming and i couldn't talk  about this for the first three days  without you know sobbing it's been  really inspiring  and and overwhelming like it's still you  know makes it really does it makes me  cry you know the what's amazing about a  random act of kindness and is the  randomness of it you had no idea that  what you did  was so much more than that  and  made me a person who is kinder  because of what you did when you learned  that strangers just like you  had given clay  upwards of ten thousand dollars to do  what you did  how does that make you feel it's  humbling  and that'